				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">TAC-genoten</h1>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3a0784f elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="3a0784f" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;stretch_section&quot;:&quot;section-stretched&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3b7df80" data-id="3b7df80" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9ff9c5b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9ff9c5b" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>TAC biedt veelbelovende makers de kans zich te ontwikkelen en te tonen aan de wereld. In ateliers aan de Ventoselaan werken ruim 60 jonge designers, kunstenaars en muzikanten. Alle TAC-genoten staan gesorteerd op studio naam.</p><p>Meer weten over waar de TAC-genoten mee bezig zijn?<br /><a href="https://www.tac.nu/tac-is-hier/">Kijk hier voor de TAC-genoten agenda</a></p><p> </p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c84bd15 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="c84bd15" data-element_type="section">
